cast have affinity for creatures.\",\n        )\n        super().__init__(**kwargs)\n\n    def cost_reduction(self, game: \"GameState\") -> int:\n        \"\"\"Affinity for creatures — its own cost reduction (generic-only).\"\"\"\n        return _creatures_you_control(game, self.controller)\n\n    def spell_cost_reduction(self, game: \"GameState\", spell: Any) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Grant affinity for creatures to your instant/sorcery spells.\n\n        E3 aggregates this into the cost of instant/sorcery spells the\n        controller casts.  The granted reduction equals the number of\n        creatures you control (which includes Witherbloom itself).\n        \"\"\"\n        return _creatures_you_control(game, self.controller)\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":135,"cache_read_input_tokens":211639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":135},"output_tokens":68,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17ee38e2-4349-4787-adbd-29e4e2a327e9","uuid":"d9e9ce9f-94a8-4c46-84c8-68ce1011a449","request_id":"req_011CbuEcw4Kqjtrt6ghJMyos"}
