reated in exile when the permanent becomes prepared and is cast **paying its {W}**. Trusted rulebook over the plan.\n- **sos_13 self-ETB** runs in `on_resolve` (verified empirically that the engine fires a card's ETB *before* registering its own triggers).\n- **sos_201 miracle** uses its own turn-stamped flag since `cards_drawn_this_turn` is never reset.\n\n`TODO.md` items are all `[x]` with one-line deviation notes; `KEY_DECISIONS.md` captures each ambiguity and card-local limitation."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":740,"cache_read_input_tokens":411496,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":740},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17ee38e2-4349-4787-adbd-29e4e2a327e9","uuid":"46f0392e-a2f7-4b74-a493-81375b4fe0cd","request_id":"req_011CbuHTGJmzjgCLmRk4p1Ja"}
